Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:54:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] ci: build static binaries on tag, document fork changes

Upstream only publishes Docker images. Tagging now produces linux/amd64 and
linux/arm64 static binaries with SHA256 sums, so bare-metal deployments do
not need Docker or a Go toolchain.
---
 .github/workflows/release-binaries.yml | 89 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 FORK-NOTES.zh-CN.md                    | 56 ++++++++++++++++
 README.md                              |  5 +-
 3 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
